{"has_data": true, "date": "2026-08-31", "groups": {"Beauty": [{"brand": "L'Oreal Luxe", "event_type": "earnings", "headline": "L'Oreal Luxe division posts 5.1% like-for-like growth in H1 2026, fragrance up double digits", "summary": "L'Oreal's H1 2026 results (late July, still driving trade coverage this week) show the Luxe division growing 5.1% like-for-like with 22.1% margin, powered by double-digit fragrance growth led by Prada Paradigme, Emporio Armani and YSL Libre; margin was diluted slightly by the first-time consolidation of Kering Beaute.", "url": "https://www.loreal-finance.com/eng/press-release/2026-half-year-results", "source": "L'Oreal Finance / Investing.com", "tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-07-30", "why_it_matters_en": "L'Oreal is proving out the exact playbook (fragrance-led scale-up via Prada/Armani/YSL) it says it will apply to Gucci Beauty from 2028 — a live benchmark for what to expect and demand.", "why_it_matters": "로레알이 프라다·아르마니·YSL에 적용 중인 향수 주도 스케일업 공식은 2028년부터 구찌 뷰티에 적용될 바로 그 플레이북이며, 구찌가 기대하고 요구해야 할 실행 벤치마크다.", "relevance": "benchmark opportunity"}, {"brand": "Prada Beauty", "event_type": "trend", "headline": "Prada Paradigme fragrance becomes a genuine blockbuster, named by L'Oreal as key H1 growth driver", "summary": "L'Oreal's own H1 2026 earnings language singles out Prada Paradigme (fronted by global ambassador Tom Holland) as having 'very rapidly established itself as a blockbuster,' with the scent also landing in Germany's 2025 fragrance top 10 shortly after launch; the earlier Paradoxe line continues generating steady viral TikTok traffic.", "url": "https://cosmeticsbusiness.com/tom-holland-named-prada-beauty-global-ambassador", "source": "Cosmetics Business / L'Oreal Finance", "tier": "T2_trade", "published_at": "2026-07-30", "why_it_matters_en": "Prada Beauty's rise under L'Oreal is the single most relevant precedent for Gucci: a Kering-adjacent, similarly positioned fashion house proving L'Oreal can turn a fragrance launch in